    /// Senders use transfer.* for every file when the target's status.modules has transfer; shelf.put stays for text, links, and files to targets without it (D-139). transfer_id is the sender's: 8-128 characters of A-Z a-z 0-9 . _ -, the same on every retry and resume (the file's sha256 hex is a good choice: a restarted sender resumes by itself). The receiver keys partials by sender and transfer_id. Beginning again with a different size or sha256 discards the old partial.
